# Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# Recommended: leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset. vite.config.ts already proxies same-origin "/api"
# requests to a native (non-Docker) backend-v2 server at http://localhost:8082 in dev, so the
# admin console works without CORS or cookie SameSite issues. Override the proxy target with
# NITTO_BACKEND_PROXY_TARGET (a shell env var, not a VITE_* one) if your backend runs elsewhere.
#
# Only set VITE_API_BASE_URL if you're intentionally pointing this CMS at a backend that is NOT
# proxied (e.g. previewing a built bundle against a remote/staging backend that has real CORS
# headers and a SameSite=None session cookie configured).
#VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8082/api
